(1) Q^2 - i s L on a generic 6-component test state: identically zero -> True
(2) {Q,Q^+} - (listed H pieces x 2) on the same test state: identically zero -> True
    sizes: test components 6, Q^2 components 27, {Q,Q+} components 27
    control A (eta hopping coefficient off by c/2) gives zero? -> False
    control B (Q without the i s v.psi term): Q^2 - i s L zero? -> False ; Q^2 itself zero? -> True
